# Security baseline: {{ ansible_hostname }}

This host is configured by the `security` Ansible role. Local edits to the files it
manages are overwritten on the next run.

## Access control

| Setting               | Value                                           |
| :-------------------- | :---------------------------------------------- |
| Minimum password      | {{ password_min_length }} characters, {{ password_min_classes }} character classes |
| Account lockout       | {{ account_lockout_attempts }} failed attempts, {{ account_lockout_time }} s |
| Session timeout       | {{ session_timeout }} s                         |
| Management network    | {{ management_network }}                        |
| Trusted networks      | {{ trusted_networks | join(', ') }}              |

## Logging and monitoring

| Setting                | Value                                          |
| :--------------------- | :--------------------------------------------- |
| Audit log retention    | {{ audit_log_retention_days }} days (max {{ audit_log_max_size }} per file) |
| SIEM forwarding        | {{ siem_protocol }}://{{ siem_server }}:{{ siem_port }} |
| File integrity (AIDE)  | checked {{ aide_check_frequency }}              |
| Vulnerability scanning | {{ vuln_scan_frequency }}, results to {{ vuln_scan_email }} |
| Compliance reporting   | {{ compliance_report_frequency }}, to {{ compliance_report_email }} |
| Incident response      | {{ incident_response_team }}, escalate after {{ incident_escalation_time }} min |

## Encryption

| Setting                | Value                                          |
| :--------------------- | :--------------------------------------------- |
| Data encryption role   | {{ 'enabled' if enable_encryption else 'disabled' }} |
| Backup encryption      | {{ 'enabled' if enable_backup_encryption else 'disabled' }} |
| Backup retention       | {{ backup_retention_days }} days               |
| TLS protocols          | {{ ssl_protocols }}                            |
| TLS ciphers            | `{{ ssl_cipher_suite }}`                       |
